    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1992631844663308
    m_Localized: (It's just a tree...the reason you can talk to it is a mistery,
      maybe it's for the magic of the dungeon that reaches its roots)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1992631844663309
    m_Localized: "The tree is blushing. \xA1You have recieved a gift!)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1992631844663310
    m_Localized: (A pine cone almost fells rights to your head...it seams it was
